OL,3,GNEWSARenovated chapel granted wedding
OL,4,Alicence
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt reopened in 2022 as an events venue,
OL,7,Fbut is now licensed for weddings, civil
OL,8,Fpartnerships and vow renewal
OL,9,Fceremonies, with an open day being held
OL,10,Ffor prospective couples on 13
OL,11,FSeptember.
